{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/37b2d37af3e2a5befa4bfcb6363619de.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/2c1b56f877c18816e8f2116d72a2d454.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/26d674c04cbdf98652212e88bb59d99d.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/26d674c04cbdf98652212e88bb59d99d.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/c591383ac52933ee6cf8aeb500660f86.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes. Also, we must quickly adapt the factory to meet the ever-changing needs of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4ad4bd101f730856e833972e3489fd92.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4c56e167e15ad0246bfff7b146997644.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4c56e167e15ad0246bfff7b146997644.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/a4c9d4c5490db2780564bcaad8a46670.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the food is ready, deliver it to the shrines as offerings to the gods. The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to face the gods\u2019 judgment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to Expect in the F.E.A.S.T Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 God Campaign:</strong> Experience a focused campaign centered around a single god, giving you a taste of the urgent challenges that await.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Mode:</strong>\u00a0Experiment freely with layouts and automation strategies without the pressure of divine deadlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Tutorials:</strong> Get up to speed quickly with essential tutorials that guide you through farming, factory building, and recipe execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 Food Recipes:</strong> Master the initial steps of gourmet cooking by preparing two distinct recipes, each requiring careful planning and automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>18 Different Factory Stations:</strong> Explore and utilize a significant variety of factory stations, allowing for complex and efficient production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/bdbebf992d315f824ee512ec79ab741f.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839270?t=1751386474","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/9fbf8f97ea95de08ac502941bea886ab2ca22112/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751386474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/9b2cd0ce29ff041fcc1081c855391ff3264990fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751386474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/9b2cd0ce29ff041fcc1081c855391ff3264990fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751386474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/37b2d37af3e2a5befa4bfcb6363619de.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/2c1b56f877c18816e8f2116d72a2d454.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/26d674c04cbdf98652212e88bb59d99d.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/26d674c04cbdf98652212e88bb59d99d.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/c591383ac52933ee6cf8aeb500660f86.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes. Also, we must quickly adapt the factory to meet the ever-changing needs of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4ad4bd101f730856e833972e3489fd92.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4c56e167e15ad0246bfff7b146997644.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/4c56e167e15ad0246bfff7b146997644.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/a4c9d4c5490db2780564bcaad8a46670.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the food is ready, deliver it to the shrines as offerings to the gods. The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to face the gods\u2019 judgment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.poster.webp?t=1751386474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.webp?t=1751386474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to Expect in the F.E.A.S.T Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 God Campaign:</strong> Experience a focused campaign centered around a single god, giving you a taste of the urgent challenges that await.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Mode:</strong>\u00a0Experiment freely with layouts and automation strategies without the pressure of divine deadlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic Tutorials:</strong> Get up to speed quickly with essential tutorials that guide you through farming, factory building, and recipe execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 Food Recipes:</strong> Master the initial steps of gourmet cooking by preparing two distinct recipes, each requiring careful planning and automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>18 Different Factory Stations:</strong> Explore and utilize a significant variety of factory stations, allowing for complex and efficient production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/extras/bdbebf992d315f824ee512ec79ab741f.avif?t=1751386474\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Before40"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3823480","name":"F.E.A.S.T"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839270/a3e5b9b30d580317deda7393656e9743780517a2/header.jpg?t=1751386474","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Legal Lines</h2><br><strong>\u00a9 2025 Before40. All rights res